Title:  Just four guys who really loved each other

Seq:    5.8.54.2.6

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Starr, Ringo|Ringo Starr]], as quoted in *[[Quoted in The Beatles Anthology (Ringo)|The Beatles Anthology]]*

Body:

There were some really loving, caring moments between four people: a hotel room here and there — a really amazing closeness. Just four guys who really loved each other. 

